#28128
xanthethereal~
xanthethereal~
Xanthethereal~
This mob transfers you out of xanth if you arent a mage.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE
AFF_ETHEREAL
0 S
1 0 0 1d1+33 1d1+16
22 RACE_HUMAN
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_FEMALE
>rand_prog 30~
mpquiet on
if rand(25)
  cast 'sanctuary' $n
else
  if rand(25)
    cast 'giant strength' $n
  else
    if rand(25)
      cast bless $n
    else
      cast heal $n
    endif
  endif
endif
mpquiet off
~
>all_greet_prog 100~
if class($n) == 6
  mpechoat $n A guard of the king comes and drags you out to mundania.
  mptransfer $n 28100
else
  if class($n) == 3
    mpechoat $n A guard of the king comes and drags you out to mundania.
    mptransfer $n 28100
  else
    if class($n) == 2
      mpechoat $n A guard of the king comes and drags you out to mundania.
      mptransfer $n 28100
    endif
  endif
endif
~
|
#28129
midasfly fly golden~
a midas fly~
A golden fly lands on you.~
It is a small fly normal in all respects except for the
fact that it is made of pure gold.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE
AFF_FLYING
0 S
30 0 0 1d1+479 1d1+21
1000 RACE_HUMAN
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_NEUTRAL
>death_prog 50~
mpquiet on
cast 'remove curse' $n
cast 'remove curse' $n
cast 'remove curse' $n
cast 'remove curse' $n
cast 'remove curse' $n
cast 'remove curse' $n
cast 'remove curse' $n
cast 'remove curse' $n
cast 'remove curse' $n
cast 'remove curse' $n
mpforce $n remove brace
mpforce $n give brace midasfly
if hasobj(bracer)
  mpjunk bracer
  mpoload 28127
  give bracer $n
  mpforce $n wear bracer
else
  if hasobj(bracelet)
    mpjunk bracelet
    mpoload 28128
    give bracelet $n
    mpforce $n wear bracelet
  else
    mpforce $n remove ring
    mpforce $n give ring midasfly
    if hasobj(ring)
      mpjunk ring
      mpoload 28129
      give ring $n
      mpforce $n wear ring
    endif
  endif
  mpquiet off
endif
~
|
#28130
needle cactus~
a needle cactus~
A needle cactus is here.~
It is a green cactus with long needle like spines.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE
0
0 S
40 0 0 10d10+600 1d10+25
1000 RACE_HUMAN
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_NEUTRAL
>greet_prog 100~
connect 4 -1
mpechoat $n The needle cactus launches a volley of needles at you as you come in range.
mpkill $n
~
>all_greet_prog 100~
connect 4 -1
~
>fight_prog 15~
mpechoat $r The needle cactus launches a volley of needles at you.
mpmadd $n currhp -20
~
>death_prog 100~
if quest(5, 3, $n) == 1
  mpmset $n quest 5 3 2
  connect 4 28184
endif
~
|
#28131
basilisk~
a basilisk~
A basilisk glares at you.~
It is a small lizard with six legs and a horn on its snout.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE
0
0 S
40 0 0 10d10+600 1d10+25
1000 RACE_HUMAN
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_NEUTRAL
>all_greet_prog 100~
mpquiet on
get basilisk
mpjunk all
if quest(5, 3, $n) != 1
  connect 3 -1
endif
mpquiet off
~
>fight_prog 40~
if actorhasobjnum(28132)
  if quest(5, 3, $n) == 0
mpechoat $n The basilisk sees itself in your mirror and is turned to stone.
    mpquiet on
    connect 3 7680
    mpoload 28133
    drop i28133
    mpmset $n quest 5 3 1
    mpquiet off
    mppurge $i
  else
    mpechoat $n The basilisk refuses to look at your mirror.
  endif
else
  mpechoat $n The basilisk glares at you and you are turned to stone!
  mpquiet on
  slay $n
  mposet corpse long A stone statue of $n is here.
  mpoadd corpse name statue
  mposet corpse desc It is an exact likeness of $n.
  mpquiet off
endif
~
|
